{{!
    @template local_balancedgroups/disclosure

    What is sent to the external service when the teacher presses "Make groups".

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - heading naming the API host
    * privacyurl - link to the service's privacy policy, or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "When you press Make groups, data is sent to group-maker.kindoflost.com",
        "privacyurl": "https://group-maker.kindoflost.com/privacy"
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-info local_balancedgroups-disclosure" role="note">
    <p><strong>{{title}}</strong></p>
    <p>{{#str}} disclosuresent, local_balancedgroups {{/str}}</p>
    <p>{{#str}} disclosurenotsent, local_balancedgroups {{/str}}</p>
    {{#privacyurl}}
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="{{privacyurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}} disclosureprivacy, local_balancedgroups {{/str}}</a></p>
    {{/privacyurl}}
</div>
